matches: "AGENT_FLOW.md:18:8. `<todos>` - call `todowrite` whenever a step starts, finishes, drops, or changes. Omitted when the agent has no `todowrite` tool.\nexample/system-prompt.md:66:When you start, finish, drop, or change a step, call `todowrite` in that same turn.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:1:# todowrite\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:54:- `todowrite: <serde error>`: argument shape did not match the schema.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:55:- `todowrite every item needs a non-empty \\`id\\`.`: missing or whitespace `id`.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:56:- `todowrite item id exceeds 64 chars.`: id too long.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:57:- `todowrite every item needs a non-empty \\`content\\`.`: blank content after trim.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:58:- `todowrite item content exceeds 200 chars.`: item too long.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:59:- `todowrite priority must be 0-10, got <n>.`: priority out of range.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:60:- `todowrite: id \\`<id>\\` already exists. Use \\`update\\` instead of \\`add\\`.`: duplicate id on add.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:61:- `todowrite update entries need a non-empty \\`id\\`.`: update with blank id.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:62:- `todowrite: cannot update unknown id \\`<id>\\`.`: update for an id that does not exist.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:63:- `todowrite update content cannot be empty.` / `... exceeds 200 chars.`: update with bad content.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:64:- `todowrite update priority must be 0-10.`: update with bad priority.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:65:- `todowrite accepts at most 64 items, got <n>.`: post-operation list too long.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:66:- `todowrite needs the desktop shell.`: `ToolContext.app` is `None` (test context).\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/README.md:67:- `todowrite needs an active session id.`: tool ran without a session id.\nexample/tool-stats/todowrite/stats.md:1:# todowrite"